{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29393","headline":"西溪 · 李商隐","name":"西溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怅望西溪水，潺湲奈尔何。\n不惊春物少，只觉夕阳多。\n色染妖韶柳，光含窈窕萝。\n人间从到海，天上莫爲河。\n凤女弹瑶瑟，龙孙撼玉珂。\n京华他夜梦，好好寄云波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}